g>{t(b('Represent the projects accurately', '准确介绍项目'),lang)}</strong>{t(b('Use the project names HAFleet, Robrix2, and Palpo as written. Keep original artwork distinct from product screenshots, and identify development integrations when describing their capabilities. Each upstream project maintains its own source and license terms.', '请准确使用 HAFleet、Robrix2 与 Palpo 项目名称。区分原创插图与产品截图，介绍开发集成能力时请明确版本状态。各上游项目分别维护自己的源码与许可证条款。'),lang)}</aside></section>}
